Title: Jens Berthel Askou: Motherwell must 'increase tempo' after 'tricky' start
Date: 2025-07-13
Firsthand information: {'Speaker': [{'Speaker': 'Jens Berthel Askou', 'Text': '"It just shows how tricky football is in general," he the manager told club media.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 3, 'StartChar': 89, 'EndChar': 145}}, {'Speaker': 'Jens Berthel Askou', 'Text': '"There\'ll always be surprises in football, especially in the cup tournaments, there will be things that don\'t go as expected.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 3, 'StartChar': 146, 'EndChar': 251}}, {'Speaker': 'Jens Berthel Askou', 'Text': '"We didn\'t get the result we wanted, obviously. A few other clubs, as far as I\'ve heard, didn\'t do that either.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 3, 'StartChar': 252, 'EndChar': 346}}, {'Speaker': 'Jens Berthel Askou', 'Text': '"And that\'s just football in general. You have to be there on the day."', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 3, 'StartChar': 347, 'EndChar': 411}}, {'Speaker': 'Jens Berthel Askou', 'Text': '"I think in terms of effort and structure, we were good," he added.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 3, 'StartChar': 534, 'EndChar': 594}}, {'Speaker': 'Jens Berthel Askou', 'Text': '"In terms of intensity, I think we pressed them with intensity.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 3, 'StartChar': 595, 'EndChar': 651}}, {'Speaker': 'Jens Berthel Askou', 'Text': '"Every time we tried to press, they put the ball in behind. I think we should have dealt better with some of their direct play.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 3, 'StartChar': 652, 'EndChar': 769}}, {'Speaker': 'Jens Berthel Askou', 'Text': '"That\'s something to improve on, definitely and then it\'s about getting the tempo up, but I\'m sure that Fir Park will give us the possibility to play at a much higher tempo."', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 3, 'StartChar': 770, 'EndChar': 892}}], 'Description': [{'Description': 'Jens Berthel Askou said Motherwell\'s draw with Clyde in the Premier Sports Cup was an example of how "tricky" football can be.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 1, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 97}}], 'Image': [{'ID': 'image_1', 'Caption': 'Motherwell Manager Jens Berthel Askou during a Premier Sports Cup group stage match between Clyde and Motherwell at New Douglas Park'}]}
